    "head_commit_message": "feat(sim): rout, tend's search and the game on the pool by default (spec 39 step 10c-iii)\n\nThe rout's flight, its rallies' searches and its regroup's enemy search,\nand tend's takers' searches, run on Rayon's pool when threaded.on says\nso; what each lands stays serial in order, so outcomes don't change.\nThe tick hands the ending's Threads to both. The game now threads from\nthe threshold by default (BREACH_NATIVE_THREADS=0 for one thread).\n\nRefs #557\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi63pvUtt6GdRsSMU9i",
